# Goddric, Cloaked Reveler: Celebration is per turn (CR 207.2c, 611.3a). Turn 1: Goddric celebrates (Black Lotus and Goddric
# entered). Turn 2: Bot2 casts a Dragon Whelp (its own permanents never count for Bot1). Turn 3: Bot1's earlier permanents don't
# count, so Goddric is a 3/3 Human Noble again with no flying and no {R} ability (refused). A Mountain (land) and a free Memnite are
# one nonland permanent: still 3/3 and no ability. A free Mox Ruby is the second: Goddric is a 4/4 flying Dragon with the ability
# again. Its {R} pumps Dragons Bot1 controls (Goddric 5/4), and not Bot2's Dragon Whelp (still 2/3).

